      "extract": "Let $M=\\|m_{ij}\\|_{n\\times n}$ be a symmetric $n\\times n$ matrix such that $m_{ii}=1,\\ 2\\leq m_{ij}\\leq\\infty$. The Coxeter group $W=W(M)$ is defined by the generators $s_1,\\cdots, s_n$ and the defining relations $(s_is_j)^{m_{ij}}=1$. A conjecture of Gröbner-Shirshov basis of any Coxeter group has proposed by L.A. Bokut and L.-S. Shiao [@bs01]. Gröbner-Shirshov bases of all finite Coxeter groups were given in",
